6.31999969482422},{"end":82.08000183105469,"text":"Oh, so baby, come on, yeah And feel me now","start":76.73999786376953},{"end":86.19999694824219,"text":"Baby, come on, yeah And heal me now","start":82.08000183105469},{"end":95.44000244140625,"text":"Show me your softer side, your softer side","start":86.19999694824219},{"end":109.13999938964844,"text":"Don't run and hide away Reach out for me, baby, reach out for me","start":96.94000244140625},{"end":122.27999877929688,"text":"Don't let all the hate envelop you And find your softer side, your softer side","start":109.13999938964844},{"end":135.02000427246094,"text":"This life won't last long If you keep carrying the hate above us","start":125.4800033569336},{"end":141,"text":"The hate below you, I need you to find your softer side","start":135.02000427246094},{"end":148.83999633789062,"text":"Don't you think it's the way you should Relate and debate with everyone","start":141},{"end":156.33999633789062,"text":"Not have this hate that you think you've not Been the only one wronged in this enemy","start":148.83999633789062},{"end":164.52000427246094,"text":"Don't you want to be better now I want you to just understand","start":156.33999633789062},{"end":172.39999389648438,"text":"You can pull the hate away, baby You can touch my softer side","start":164.52000427246094},{"end":187.52000427246094,"text":"Oh, it all goes down There's no compassion leading us now","start":172.39999389648438},{"end":197.39999389648438,"text":"I wish you could have loved me well I wish you could have touched me a little softer","start":187.52000427246094},{"end":206.3800048828125,"text":"And felt that love there above us Baby, now, now you go back","start":198.39999389648438},{"end":217.27999877929688,"text":"Don't run and hide as I cry our life away With these tears and only your hate brings","start":206.3800048828125},{"end":227.5,"text":"Oh, I wish you would put down your mask Your heart so soft and make this thing last","start":218.55999755859375},{"end":236.27999877929688,"text":"Cause our love deserves it Yeah, that softer side","start":227.5},{"end":248.24000549316406,"text":"The love side, the love side The fun that helps us through our suffering","start":238.83999633789062},{"end":257.7799987792969,"text":"It's like your love is buffering in my zone I wish you would have known","start":249.66000366210938},{"end":263.7799987792969,"text":"The softer side, the softer side","start":258.7799987792969},{"end":279.239990234375,"text":"I can't ever think about that again I lost the will to call you my friend","start":266.7799987792969}],"unlock":{"card":"card-133","fragments":10},"chartVersion":"v6_master","chartReport":{"version":"v6_master","bpm":122.39,"catalogBpm":170,"tempoConfidence":0,"beats":570,"bars":141,"repeatedBars":66,"povTimes":[105.616,221.693],"typeCounts":{"tap":306,"hold":66,"slide":16,"swipe":11,"accent":4,"hold-swipe":7},"ms":60}}